{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117402","id":3396916329,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KeNRp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117402","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117402.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117402.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117402","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117402/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117402/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117402/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7a99a2c7828e64439c421119358615f4ccee3e68","number":117402,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove unused includes in `modules` with clangd-tidy","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111218.\r\n- Follow-up to #117286.\r\n- Follow-up to #117295.\r\n- Follow-up to #117301.\r\n- Follow-up to #117328.\r\n- Follow-up to #117366.\r\n\r\n~I left out Jolt which @mihe will take a look at - its thirdparty includes should use angled brackets to remove warnings, and then there's a few actually unused/not directly used headers that can be cleaned up.~ *Edit:* Added in the end as it was trivial.\r\n\r\nI should have done the same for the OpenXR module as it turned out pretty hairy. `openxr_platform_inc.h` is horrifying, pulling a ton of platform specific stuff in headers when most of the time it just needs `vulkan.h` or some Metal header. I strongly recommend refactoring this further and decoupling OpenXR stuff as much as possible from platform-specific includes in headers. There also seems to be a pattern of including `openxr_api.h` and `openxr_util.h` everywhere even when not needed just to get `<openxr/openxr.h>` or a few other dependencies. These things add up and likely make recompile times pretty bad for folks working on OpenXR, so I advise you look into reducing the use of this pattern.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://